// Maya 14-Day Dialogue Arc

=== maya_day1 ===
hey wanderer! saw you logged into Pulse from the motel DSL :)
did you settle into Room 104 okay? how is the copper line holding up over there?
+ [Hey Maya! Yeah, just got unpacked. The copper line here is surprisingly fast.]
    # beat:maya_day1_complete
    # social:maya:empathy
    haha yeah! Mr. Henderson patched the junction box last month. Glad it works!
    im working the late shift at 4th St Diner tonight. Come by later if you want coffee or fries! (C)
    -> DONE
+ [Settled in fine. The rain outside is intense, but the neon sign is right outside my window.]
    # beat:maya_day1_complete
    # social:maya:vulnerable_share
    oh i LOVE that neon sign! (:camera:) I took a bunch of 35mm exposures of the reflection in the puddles.
    uploaded them to myplace.local/maya_x if you wanna see them. Stay warm!
    -> DONE
+ [Just testing the connection. Lots of noise on the phone line.]
    # beat:maya_day1_complete
    # social:maya:intellectual_curiosity
    yeah, the copper wires run right under the canal bridge. Nora said there is some strange frequency hum on it at night.
    check NightBoard thread #104 if you like solving local mysteries. Talk to you soon!
    -> DONE

=== maya_day10 ===
so... I was thinking. We’ve been chatting on Pulse every night for ten days straight.
would you like to meet in person tomorrow afternoon? I have a table reserved by the corner window at 4th St Diner around 3:00 PM (15:00). I can bring my physical 35mm portfolio!
+ [I would love that more than anything, Maya. 3:00 PM at 4th St Diner — I’ll be there.]
    # beat:maya_day10_complete
