=== maya_day14 ===
fourteen days, wanderer... two whole weeks.
when you first logged in on Day 1, I thought you were just another passing traveler. But you became my anchor.
+ [You gave me a reason to look forward to every single evening, Maya. This isn’t the end — it’s just the foundation.]
    # beat:maya_day14_complete
